    "title": "Local ordinances aim to protect wildlife - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Guest Writer ,\n1 days ago Life is precarious for wild animals living close to roads in Anacortes and on San Juan Island. Some 59 deer have been struck by motor vehicles in Anacortes since January 2024, according to the Anacortes Police Department. Thirty-three of those deer died instantly or were mortally injured and put out of their misery with a law enforcement officer’s gun. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
